  _category: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67eb6452bf5f2224083042268f30f622, type: 2}
  _glyph: "\U0001F331\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: How can I start fresh with my own Lore?
  _description: 'A Unity project holds **one** Lore Project, and right now that is
    this demo. Delete the sample folder Assets/Samples/Lore (it contains the whole
    demo), then open Tools > Lore > Open Lore: the Welcome page lets you start your
    own Lore.


    You can import the demo again at any time from Package Manager
    > Lore > Samples, but only while you have no Lore Project of your own.'
